{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/4ae7c9c589299cc7c888daaa1e55fe2a.poster.avif?t=1762442355\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/4ae7c9c589299cc7c888daaa1e55fe2a.webm?t=1762442355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/4ae7c9c589299cc7c888daaa1e55fe2a.mp4?t=1762442355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shoot Your Friends </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a seat at the new 4-way multiplayer table. Bargain. Beg. Betray. Become the ultimate victor. Walk away rich. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/c56a26ad4b01b821c093ceef17162778.poster.avif?t=1762442355\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/c56a26ad4b01b821c093ceef17162778.webm?t=1762442355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/c56a26ad4b01b821c093ceef17162778.mp4?t=1762442355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >12-Gauge Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play Russian roulette with a 12-gauge. Cause shotguns just feel better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/8ef4f9481329a91f17a298df1e202a29.poster.avif?t=1762442355\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/8ef4f9481329a91f17a298df1e202a29.webm?t=1762442355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/8ef4f9481329a91f17a298df1e202a29.mp4?t=1762442355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Literally Mindblowing Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 15 to 20-minute intense playtime. Enter the arena, go three rounds against The Dealer, and walk away with the prize. Or don't. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/904177ed537036bc572348703bd20167.poster.avif?t=1762442355\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/904177ed537036bc572348703bd20167.webm?t=1762442355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/904177ed537036bc572348703bd20167.mp4?t=1762442355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Welcome to the underground nightclub, where metal railings pulse to the beats of forgotten drum machines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/adbd6784cab14bff598e532681e2b2fc.poster.avif?t=1762442355\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/adbd6784cab14bff598e532681e2b2fc.webm?t=1762442355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/adbd6784cab14bff598e532681e2b2fc.mp4?t=1762442355\" t